摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Telegram messenger bridge for DeepSeek Harness: sessions, steer, homes, and TTS voice notes","id":"gh:1347427335","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-messenger-gateway","slug":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-messenger-gateway","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Telegram messenger bridge for DeepSeek Harness: sessions, steer, homes, and TTS voice notes"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 📦 @goodandready/dsh-messenger-gateway"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Telegram Messenger Bridge with Interactive Buttons, Forum Topics & Voice Notes for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🇬🇧 English •\n🇷🇺 Русский •\n🇨🇳 中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"⭐ If you like this plugin, please star it on GitHub — it shows me that the plugin is useful to you a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd motivates me to keep developing it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🐛 If you find a bug or would like to request a feature, open a GitHub issue in any language — I will"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" review your proposal and implement useful suggestions in a future plugin version."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ⚡ Overview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**`dsh-messenger-gateway`** provides an enterprise-grade, multi-transport messaging gateway for **De"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"epSeek Harness** agents.\nTalk to your Harness agent directly from Telegram: interactive keyboard but"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"tons, forum topic sessions, private user workspaces, pairing codes, and optional spoken voice replie"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ns, forum topic sessions, private user workspaces, pairing codes, and optional spoken voice replies."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Talk to your Harness agent from Telegram: text, voice, photos, documents, inline buttons, named home"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"s, and optional spoken replies."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Long-poll or webhook Telegram bot\n- Configurable proxy support: HTTP, HTTPS, SOCKS5, and SOCKS5h ("},{"id":"p11s2","text":"`telegram.proxyUrl`)\n- Custom Bot API root URL (`telegram.apiRoot`) for reverse proxies and local Bo"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"t API servers\n- Multi-transport support: Telegram, Discord (Webhooks & Bot API), and Slack (Webhooks"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" & Bot API)\n- Allowlist + pairing codes\n- Per-user or per-chat sessions (`sessionScope`)\n- Forum top"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ics as separate sessions\n- Quick actions reply keyboard (`/keyboard on|off`)\n- Multi-select interact"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"ive ask forms with checkboxes and pagination (`messenger_ask`)\n- Artifact & Mermaid diagram renderin"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"g (SVG cards) and monospace table formatting\n- Agent roles & personas (`/role coder`, `/role archite"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"ct`, `@role` tags in group chats)\n- Agent tools & skills inspection (`/skills`, `/tools`)\n- Session "},{"id":"p11s9","text":"management: dialogue history export to Markdown (`/export`), turn rewind (`/rewind`), session branch"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"ing (`/fork`)\n- Workspace file manager (`/files [dir]`) and file download (`/get <path>`) with direc"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"tory traversal protection\n- Admin alert channel for pairing requests, model errors and monitoring (`"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"/setalert`, `/alert`)\n- Persistent scheduled reminders (`/remind <time> <text>`, `/remind list`, `/r"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"emind cancel`)\n- Inbound webhook event dispatcher (`POST /dsh-messenger-gateway/events`) for CI/CD a"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"nd external alerts\n- Steer: follow-up messages while the agent is busy (instead of aborting)\n- `/sto"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"p`, `/new`, `/model`, `/status`, `/voice`, `/sethome`, `/home`\n- Agent tool `messenger_ask` (inline "},{"id":"p11s16","text":"keyboard answers return to the agent)\n- Named homes for outbound notify / `messenger.send`\n- Optiona"},{"id":"p11s17","text":"l notify bridge: web session events → Telegram home (excludes messenger sessions)\n- Inbound voice → "},{"id":"p11s18","text":"STT (`dsh-voice`), photos → vision (`dsh-vision-bridge`)\n- Optional TTS replies (`dsh-tts`); mp3 is "},{"id":"p11s19","text":"converted to OGG/Opus via `ffmpeg` for Telegram voice notes"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Discord and Slack adapters are available as outbound transports (Webhooks or Bot REST APIs)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Then open **Settings → Plugins → Messenger gateway**:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Enable Telegram\n2. Paste the BotFather token (write-only; leave blank to keep the current token)\n"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"3. Set allowed Telegram user IDs (or use pairing)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Optional companion plugins (same profile)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Plugin | Role |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `@goodandready/dsh-voice` | Transcribe inbound voice messages |\n| `@goodandready/dsh-tts` | Speak "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"agent replies |\n| `@goodandready/dsh-vision-bridge` | Describe inbound photos |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"They are **not** npm dependencies of this package — install them separately if you want those featur"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"y are **not** npm dependencies of this package — install them separately if you want those features."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Voice notes"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Spoken replies use Telegram `sendVoice`. If TTS returns MP3 (or other non-Opus audio), the gateway r"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"uns `ffmpeg` (`libopus`) to produce OGG. If `ffmpeg` is missing or conversion fails, the audio is se"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"nt as a regular audio file instead of a voice note."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Commands (Telegram)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Command | Description |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `/start` `/help` | Help |\n| `/whoami` | Your Telegram user id |\n| `/new` | New agent session |\n| `"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"/stop` | Abort the current turn |\n| `/model` | Interactive 2-step model picker (providers → models) "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"or `/model <prov> <mod>` |\n| `/status` | Gateway status and session counters |\n| `/top` | Live serve"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"r resources: RSS/Heap memory, uptime, active chats, reminders |\n| `/topic <name>` | Create a new Tel"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"egram forum topic in supergroups and start an isolated session |\n| `/role [name]` | Switch agent per"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"sona (`coder`, `architect`, `reviewer`, `writer`, `translator`, `concise`) |\n| `/skills` `/tools` | "},{"id":"p25s7","text":"List active agent tools and capabilities |\n| `/fork` | Fork current session into a new independent s"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"ession |\n| `/export` | Export session dialogue history to Markdown |\n| `/rewind [N]` | Rewind last N"},{"id":"p25s9","text":" conversation turns |\n| `/files [dir]` | Workspace file manager |\n| `/get <path>` | Download file fr"},{"id":"p25s10","text":"om workspace |\n| `/remind <time> <text>` | Set a reminder (e.g. `/remind 15m Call client`) |\n| `/set"},{"id":"p25s11","text":"alert` `/alert` | Configure admin alert channel and send test alert |\n| `/keyboard on\\|off` | Toggle"},{"id":"p25s12","text":" quick actions reply keyboard |\n| `/voice on\\|off` | Per-user spoken replies |\n| `/tts on\\|off\\|stat"},{"id":"p25s13","text":"us` | Per-chat spoken replies |\n| `/sethome [name]` | Bind current chat/topic as a named home |\n| `/"},{"id":"p25s14","text":"home` | List homes |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Multi-Transport Support (Discord & Slack)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"In addition to Telegram, outbound messages can be dispatched to Discord and Slack via Webhooks or Bo"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"t APIs:\n- **Discord:** set `discord.enabled: true`, provide either `webhookUrl` or `botToken`. Targe"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"t channels via `chatId: \"<channel_id>\"`.\n- **Slack:** set `slack.enabled: true`, provide either `web"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"hookUrl` or `botToken`. Target channels via `chatId: \"<channel_id>\"` or threads via `threadId: \"<thr"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"r `botToken`. Target channels via `chatId: \"<channel_id>\"` or threads via `threadId: \"<thread_ts>\"`."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Agent tools & HTTP"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Tool: `messenger_ask` — ask the user with inline buttons; choice is fed back into the turn\n- HTTP "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"(when enabled): `/messenger/send`, `/messenger/ask`, `/messenger/progress`\n- Cordis service: `ctx.me"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ssenger` for other plugins"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness web (or compatible) profile\n- Node.js matching your Harness install\n- For voice n"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"otes from non-Opus TTS: `ffmpeg` on the host `PATH`"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
